        "contentType": "VIDEO",
        "title": "Aehr Test Systems Pops 30% After Earnings",
        "description": "Aehr Test Systems has been on an absolute roll, and surged nearly 30% following its latest quarterly financial results. During a recent episode of The AI Investor Podcast, co-hosts Eric Bleeker and Austin Smith examined why it has been so hot and whether or not it shows any signs of slowing down. The two broke down how Aehr Test Systems adjusted its revenue guidance to the high end of expectations at $150 million for the year while securing major customer wins. The discussion also explores the critical role Aehr Test Systems plays in satisfying the growing burn-in test demand for complex chips in an evolving artificial intelligence landscape.",
